    "body": "This is not quite right if non-node target resides outside a shadow tree.  It's possible for hit region, etc... to exist outside a shadow and the event path to enter a shadow tree via a slot.  So we need to add _item_ only if it's _unclosed_ to the first `Node` that appears after such a non-Node target.\n",
