    "body": "Well, path can contain both due to the `Window` object (exposed to JavaScript as the `WindowProxy` object), but that is only ever at the end. I will at a note saying that the ongoing assumption is that if the target is a non-node, the eventual path will also not contain nodes. I think that holds.\n",
